From e1e99c8c387c4d66b1461d89aef833ab88d4ee22 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: netplay <netplay@localhost>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 14:18:50 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Netplay determinism (SPEC 14.1): the Z80's ROM in the
 SDRAM (copied from DDR3 at load), the YM2610 never waits for DDR3 with
 Netplay on, the YM2610's dividers and slot counter, the LSPC timer, the
 auto-animation counter and the SDRAM refresh counter start from the reset's
 end; OSD Netplay O[46:45]; npsim: --snap/snapdiff.py, det.sh starts as a
 session does
---
